error[L0404]: `score` does not implement `ord`
 --> check/missing_order.rslisp:4:10
  |
4 |   (sort! scores)
  |          ^^^^^^ this needs `ord`
  |
  = note: `ord` is never inferred for a struct, so the struct needs a written `derive`
  = help: add `(derive score clone partial-eq eq hash show ord)` to compare fields in this order: `points`, then `name`
  = help: to sort by one field instead, use `sort-by!` with the field keyword `:points`
